//
// Bytewise correctness for all OCB-unrolled conv ELFs.
//
// For each production OCB layer in conv/build_ocb._LAYERS, runs the
// n_ocb-unrolled ELF once with concatenated weights and compares each
// per-OCB output slice against an n_ocb=1 reference ELF run n_ocb times
// with each individual weight. PASS = all slices match bytewise.
//
// Both the production OCB ELFs and the n_ocb=1 reference ELFs are built
// on demand into MDV6_BUILD_DIR/build_merged/.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, torch
//
// RUN: rm -rf test_stx
// RUN: mkdir -p test_stx
// RUN: cd test_stx
//
// RUN: env MDV6_BUILD_DIR=. %run_on_npu2% python3 %S/conv/test_ocb.py --layer all
